{"ref":"BDB, רַ֫עַם","hw":"רַ֫עַם","html":"† <big><span dir=\"rtl\">רַ֫עַם</span></big>  <strong>n.</strong>[<strong>m.</strong>] <strong>thunder</strong>;—ascribed to <span dir=\"rtl\">י׳</span>: <span dir=\"rtl\">ר׳</span> abs. <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 29:6\" href=\"/Isaiah.29.6\">Is 29:6</a>, <span dir=\"rtl\">בְּסֵתֶר רַ֑עַם</span> <a data-ref=\"Psalms 81:8\" href=\"/Psalms.81.8\">ψ 81:8</a> (Baer Gi; i. e. thunder-cloud); sf. <span dir=\"rtl\">קוֹל רַעַמְךָ</span> <a data-ref=\"Psalms 77:19\" href=\"/Psalms.77.19\">77:19</a>; <a data-ref=\"Psalms 104:7\" href=\"/Psalms.104.7\">104:7</a>; cstr. <span dir=\"rtl\">רַעַם גבורתו</span> <a data-ref=\"Job 26:14\" href=\"/Job.26.14\">Jb 26:14</a> (fig. of <span dir=\"rtl\">י׳</span>’s display of might; opp. <span dir=\"rtl\">שֵׁמֶץ</span>); fig. of captins, <span dir=\"rtl\">ר׳ שָׂרִים</span> <a data-ref=\"Job 39:25\" href=\"/Job.39.25\">39:25</a>, i.e. thunderous shouting (+ <span dir=\"rtl\">תְּרוּעָה</span>).","next":"BDB, רָעַם","prev":"BDB, רעם"}